run 1 wrote r13-disk-reclaim.{log,rc}, rc 0 (its log is kept as -run1.log). A first retry never ran: an edit left the script unparseable and the trailing echo wrote 2 into r13-disk-reclaim.rc; -run1.rc restores the 0 that run 1 exited with, read from the log it wrote. The retry below is run 2.
Run 2 (-deps) removed the memvault 010-b worktree target (351M); the three node_modules removals ended "Directory not empty" only because Finder rewrote .DS_Store files during rm (92 KB left: 5, 2 and 3 .DS_Store files), which were left in place, as on 2026-09-26. taxipro-backend/node_modules (two long-running node scripts have their cwd there) and sales-platform were not touched. Free disk 5.58 -> 11.07 GiB.
